"lines": [
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "He checked his bank account, and saw a hundred and twenty thousand dollars that wasn't his.",
"start": 0.0,
"end": 4.05
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "The day before, he had just eleven hundred dollars.",
"start": 4.21,
"end": 6.68
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "One teller made one mistake. The money was meant for a business.",
"start": 6.83,
"end": 9.83
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "So he asked himself one question. Is it mine now?",
"start": 9.98,
"end": 12.57
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "He didn't call the bank. He went shopping.",
"start": 12.77,
"end": 14.58
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Fifteen thousand dollars down on an SUV.",
"start": 14.73,
"end": 17.08
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Two four-wheelers. A camper. A race car.",
"start": 17.23,
"end": 19.25
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Then fifteen thousand more, handed out to friends.",
"start": 19.4,
"end": 21.76
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "In two and a half weeks, over a hundred thousand dollars was gone.",
"start": 21.91,
"end": 24.96
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Then the bank noticed.",
"start": 25.11,
"end": 26.35
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "It pulled the money back out. All of it.",
"start": 26.5,
"end": 28.43
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "His balance dropped to minus a hundred and seven thousand dollars.",
"start": 28.58,
"end": 31.86
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "The bank called. His wife picked up.",
"start": 32.01,
"end": 33.75
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "She said they'd work out a way to pay it back.",
"start": 33.9,
"end": 35.9
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Then they stopped answering.",
"start": 36.05,
"end": 37.42
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "So who's right? The bank made the mistake.",
"start": 37.62,
"end": 39.54
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Can a bank really make you pay for its own error?",
"start": 39.69,
"end": 41.85
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Then the police knocked on the door.",
"start": 42.05,
"end": 43.8
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Police say they admitted the money wasn't theirs.",
"start": 43.95,
"end": 46.31
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "The charges? Theft, and receiving stolen property.",
"start": 46.46,
"end": 49.03
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Here's the answer. A bank's mistake is still the bank's money.",
"start": 49.23,
"end": 52.02
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "If you know it's not yours and spend it, that can be theft.",
"start": 52.17,
"end": 54.8
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "This really happened to a couple in Pennsylvania, in 2019.",
"start": 54.95,
"end": 58.37
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Would you have called the bank, or gone shopping? Comment one.",
"start": 58.52,
"end": 61.08
}
]
}